Scope

These terms apply to the copy of Sellissimo supplied with this agreement. In this
agreement, “Sellissimo” means the Sellissimo Core, Stripe, Mollie and Flat
Rate Shipping packages distributed by heureka Kreatív Kft. (“we” or “us”).
“You” means the individual or organization exercising the rights below.

Development and staging

You may install, evaluate, test and customize Sellissimo free of charge on
any number of development and staging installations. A site that takes real
customer orders is a production site, even if it uses a staging domain.

Written production authorization

You may operate a production site during the period covered by written
authorization from heureka Kreatív Kft. Existing written approvals remain
valid for the operator, site and period they specify. For continued use
after that period, obtain an extension or a production site license.
Access to release files alone grants development and staging rights only.

Production license and renewal

At commercial launch, the first 100 buyers pay USD 49 for one production
site. The regular price is USD 99 per site. Each purchase includes one year
of updates and support from the date of purchase. The site
operator may install any combination of the four packages on that site. Each
additional production site requires its own license.

Renewal is optional at USD 49 per year for all buyers, including the first
100. Renewal covers updates and support for one year. You may keep
using any version covered by your purchase or renewal on the licensed site
after that coverage ends. Continued production use of a covered version does
not require annual payment.

Agencies and plugin developers

You may make backup copies and modify Sellissimo for a site you are entitled
to operate. You may engage an agency or contractor to install, maintain and
customize Sellissimo on your behalf. Acting for a licensed client does not
give an agency a license for another client's production site.

You may copy and adapt the bundled local-pickup example and extension
generator templates, including the code produced by the generator. You may
publish, distribute and sell independent plugins incorporating that material
under terms you choose. You retain the rights to your original contributions.
Your users obtain Sellissimo separately. Except for this express permission
and the site work permitted above, you may not redistribute, sublicense or
resell Sellissimo or modified copies of it. Preserve the copyright and
license notices in copies of the Sellissimo packages you make.

Third-party material

Third-party code and data retain their own licenses. Core includes the
notices for its address data in resources/address-data-NOTICE.txt,
